// ============================================
// RELATIONSHIPS SUMMARY
// ============================================

// One-to-Many:
// - CustomUser → Client (one user owns many clients)
// - CustomUser → MessageTemplate (one user owns many templates)
// - CustomUser → Campaign (one user owns many campaigns)
// - MessageTemplate → Campaign (one template can be used in many campaigns, PROTECT)

// Many-to-Many:
// - Campaign ↔ Client (via campaigns_campaign_clients)

